    pack directory.


Modifications
-------------
Required to be indicated by CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 section 3(a)(1)(B). These are the
only changes made to this pack:

    * actions.xml — the UTF-8 byte-order mark was removed.
    * actions.xml — `Math.random*100` was corrected to `Math.random()*100`
      (2 occurrences; this expression computes the wall-climb target and
      otherwise evaluates to NaN).
    * info.json — a `"license"` field was added. No other field was changed.
    * img/*.png — byte-for-byte identical to upstream, unmodified.
    * behaviors.xml, bubble_context.txt — byte-for-byte identical, unmodified.


